  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to mature the ASEAN-EU project on Circular Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark has signed a contribution agreement with EU on implementing a project on Circular Economy (CE) in ASEAN. The assistance asked for is to support the transition from project document into a viable project with a robust organisational set-up which includes identifying implementing partners and formulation of contracts/tenders for project implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
